STR_GRF_NAME :Hunninghall Grand Union Air Terminal 1.0
STR_GRF_DESC :A major 9x11 airport with four runways. It uses the same runways, taxiways, hangars and flight pattern as the Intercontinental airport, with its own terminal, control tower and buildings.
